MAIN
MOVE TEMP 0 HALLOCATE 16
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 BBS_Start
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 BBS_Sort
HSTORE TEMP 0 8 BBS_Print
HSTORE TEMP 0 12 BBS_Init
MOVE TEMP 1 HALLOCATE 0
MOVE TEMP 2 HALLOCATE 12
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 16
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 BBS_Start
HSTORE TEMP 3 4 BBS_Sort
HSTORE TEMP 3 8 BBS_Print
HSTORE TEMP 3 12 BBS_Init
HSTORE TEMP 2 0 TEMP 3
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 0
MOVE TEMP 6 CALL TEMP 5 ( TEMP 2 10 ) 
PRINT TEMP 6
END
BBS_Start [2]
BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 3 12
MOVE TEMP 5 CALL TEMP 4 ( TEMP 0 TEMP 1 ) 
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 8
MOVE TEMP 8 CALL TEMP 7 ( TEMP 0 ) 
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 8
PRINT 99999
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 4
MOVE TEMP 11 CALL TEMP 10 ( TEMP 0 ) 
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 11
HLOAD TEMP 12 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 12 8
MOVE TEMP 14 CALL TEMP 13 ( TEMP 0 ) 
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 14
RETURN 0
END
BBS_Sort [1]
BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 0 8
MOVE TEMP 2 MINUS TEMP 10 1
MOVE TEMP 3 MINUS 0 1
L0
NOOP
CJUMP LE TEMP 3 MINUS TEMP 2 1 L1
MOVE TEMP 8 1
L2
NOOP
CJUMP LE TEMP 8 TEMP 2 L3
MOVE TEMP 7 MINUS TEMP 8 1
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 12 PLUS TEMP 11 PLUS TIMES TEMP 7 4 4
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 12 0
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 13
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 15 PLUS TEMP 14 PLUS TIMES TEMP 8 4 4
HLOAD TEMP 16 TEMP 15 0
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 16
CJUMP LE TEMP 5 MINUS TEMP 4 1 L4
MOVE TEMP 6 MINUS TEMP 8 1
HLOAD TEMP 17 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 18 PLUS TEMP 17 PLUS TIMES TEMP 6 4 4
HLOAD TEMP 19 TEMP 18 0
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 19
HLOAD TEMP 20 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 21 PLUS TEMP 20 PLUS TIMES TEMP 8 4 4
HLOAD TEMP 22 TEMP 21 0
HLOAD TEMP 23 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 24 PLUS TEMP 23 PLUS TIMES TEMP 6 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 24 0 TEMP 22
HLOAD TEMP 25 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 26 PLUS TEMP 25 PLUS TIMES TEMP 8 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 26 0 TEMP 9
JUMP L5
L4
NOOP
MOVE TEMP 1 0
L5
NOOP
MOVE TEMP 8 PLUS TEMP 8 1
JUMP L2
L3
NOOP
MOVE TEMP 2 MINUS TEMP 2 1
JUMP L0
L1
NOOP
RETURN 0
END
BBS_Print [1]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 1 0
L6
NOOP
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 8
CJUMP LE TEMP 1 MINUS TEMP 2 1 L7
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 4 PLUS TEMP 3 PLUS TIMES TEMP 1 4 4
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 0
PRINT TEMP 5
MOVE TEMP 1 PLUS TEMP 1 1
JUMP L6
L7
NOOP
RETURN 0
END
BBS_Init [2]
BEGIN
HSTORE TEMP 0 8 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 2 HALLOCATE TIMES PLUS TEMP 1 1 4
HSTORE TEMP 2 0 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 2
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 4 PLUS TEMP 3 PLUS TIMES 0 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 4 0 20
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 6 PLUS TEMP 5 PLUS TIMES 1 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 7
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 8 PLUS TEMP 7 PLUS TIMES 2 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 8 0 12
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 10 PLUS TEMP 9 PLUS TIMES 3 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 10 0 18
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 12 PLUS TEMP 11 PLUS TIMES 4 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 12 0 2
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 14 PLUS TEMP 13 PLUS TIMES 5 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 14 0 11
HLOAD TEMP 15 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 16 PLUS TEMP 15 PLUS TIMES 6 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 16 0 6
HLOAD TEMP 17 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 18 PLUS TEMP 17 PLUS TIMES 7 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 18 0 9
HLOAD TEMP 19 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 20 PLUS TEMP 19 PLUS TIMES 8 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 20 0 19
HLOAD TEMP 21 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 22 PLUS TEMP 21 PLUS TIMES 9 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 22 0 5
RETURN 0
END
